changes the evidence and may motivate a correction, but does not itself
grant authority.

This adds only a method manifest and operator documentation. No Core
object, no Protocol surface, no code. The Check runs on the existing
vela verification record mechanism.

methods/current/known-result-and-duplicate-search.v1.json names the eight
sources, the exact query string or command and locator form for each, the
rights boundary for each, the declared-scope and search-log recording
format, the outcome semantics, and the seven mandatory nonclaims.

KNOWN_RESULT_SEARCH.md is the operator sequence, and states that a fail
outcome motivates a corrected or superseding Submission rather than any
automatic action.

