 ref, so it cannot be re-fetched at a revision. The adapter binds its byte root, checks out the commit the Pages deployment API names as the one whose build is served, and proves that every referenced source path exists there."}]'::jsonb, 'sha256:a10796d13044ef5f9700b43b804c4c7ed4f326ad1bd8e204933baa3b53517f2e');
